From 6e96bb236a08cb17574b989f2435fd3ffee31e76 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 15:16:39 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Stage Avalanche vote batches and retain native immature and
 persisted peers

Maintenance explanation added during mailbox export:
Stage Avalanche vote batches before applying their effects and retain native immature and persisted peer proof state. Extend tests to cover these lifecycle states so proof transitions and block decisions do not expose partial updates.

